WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.915
Today we will explore repeated structure through weaving. Our work connects with our

00:00:04.915 --> 00:00:06.003
own local community.

00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:09.747
Lay parallel paper strips on a desk as the base.

00:00:10.867 --> 00:00:13.299
Pass one strip over then under the base strips.

00:00:14.867 --> 00:00:17.640
Repeat the sequence and straighten the finished pattern.
